<title>FINLAND: Tampella plans name switch to Tamrock.</title>
<headline>Tampella plans name switch to Tamrock.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Tampella Oy said its board proposed that the company be renamed Tamrock Oy.</p>
<p>Tampella would call an extraordinary shareholders' meeting to decide about changing the company's name to Tamrock Oy, Tampella said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
